A practical reading of the two halves:

  - the memory engine (slot/capacity/decay/hash-chain/replay mechanics) and
    this plugin's packaging  →  Apache-2.0: learn from it, fork it, ship it.
  - the story (the card pool, the script, the endings)  →  mine. Copying
    it is copyright infringement; this notice ships inside the package, and
    the package sha256 is pinned in the store catalog.
